> If my help as a developer, tester, or documenter would be appreciated,

Your help is indeed most welcome. There are many possible areas for contribution depending on your interests:

- documentation/tutorials
- more of the automated tests
- LTTV would benefit from restructuring work, some is underway but not as actively as would be needed, in C/C++
- There are several views/enhancements that could be added to Eclipse TMF, in java
- There are a number of enhancements to the core tracing infrastructure which are planned but not yet implemented (flight recorder mode, init time tracing, filters in kernel mode...)
